# Screenshot review artefacts.
# These are generated by `npm run screens:*` purely so layout defects can be
# eyeballed during development. Nothing in the app or the docs links to them,
# and at ~800 KB each they grew to 28 MB — enough to make the whole project
# slow or impossible to upload. They are disposable: regenerate any time.
